OL,3,GNEWSAGales cancel evening ferry
OL,4,Asailings
OL,5,
OL,6,FFerry crossings between the Isle of Man
OL,7,Fand Northern Ireland have been
OL,8,Fcancelled due to choppy conditions in
OL,9,Fthe Irish Sea.
OL,11,FThe 19:00 GMT sailing of the
OL,12,FBen-my-Chree to Larne, along with its
OL,13,Fovernight return, have been called off
OL,14,Fby the Isle of Man Steam Packet due to
OL,15,Fstrong winds.
OL,17,FRonaldsway Met Office has warned of
OL,18,Fgales over the north Irish Sea later.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
